Enhancement: Provide Windows arm64 release binaries

Restic releases did not contain binaries for Windows arm64, so arm64 users
had to build restic themselves and restic self-update could not find an
asset for their platform. Restic releases now include a
restic_<version>_windows_arm64.zip, and restic self-update works on
Windows arm64.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/3596
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22188
